(7548308, 1208966, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>That looks like one precarious perch! It just wouldnt be the same without his green coat, it certainly makes him different but probably most of all his outstretched leg completes it. Underneath it all hes actually quite distinctively marked, anyway, a most appropriate choice for the challenge, well done Ronnie.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well That looks like one precarious perch! It just wouldnt be the same without his green coat, it certainly makes him different but probably most of all his outstretched leg completes it. Underneath it all hes actually quite distinctively marked, anyway, a most appropriate choice for the challenge, well done Ronnie.', '2017-12-14 05:46:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7548309, 1208721, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>This is a lovely portrait. She is a lovely looking girl with a lovely natural smile that beams out at you. I like the way you have animated the image with her throwing the leaves, your timing is good avoiding the falling leaves obscuring any part of her face and I also like the way they are back-lit they stand out from the soft focus subdued background. Whilst I like a square crop I think her hands would be too close to the edges this is preferable. Well done Daniel, congratslations on the ribbon.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well This is a lovely portrait. She is a lovely looking girl with a lovely natural smile that beams out at you. I like the way you have animated the image with her throwing the leaves, your timing is good avoiding the falling leaves obscuring any part of her face and I also like the way they are back-lit they stand out from the soft focus subdued background. Whilst I like a square crop I think her hands would be too close to the edges this is preferable. Well done Daniel, congratslations on the ribbon.', '2017-12-14 05:55:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7548310, 1208979, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes to the challenge<br/> <br/>What an amazing rock strata, such subtle and beautiful colours. I like your composition, full of beautiful layers and forms, all really pleasing to the eye, its the sort of image that you can look at for a long time and continue to be stimulated by, I like it a lot. In terms of the challenge I failed to see how it fulfils the challenge brief, but having reread it does say something.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes to the challenge What an amazing rock strata, such subtle and beautiful colours. I like your composition, full of beautiful layers and forms, all really pleasing to the eye, its the sort of image that you can look at for a long time and continue to be stimulated by, I like it a lot. In terms of the challenge I failed to see how it fulfils the challenge brief, but having reread it does say something.', '2017-12-14 06:03:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7548314, 1208721, 69838, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your lovely comments!  <br/>And, I''m sure the model (Dani) will be very excited to read all of these!</td>', 'Thank you all for your lovely comments!  And, I''m sure the model (Dani) will be very excited to read all of these!', '2017-12-14 09:48:23.000000', NULL, 0),
